# Deal Risk Audit — environment variables
#
# By default this agent uses OAuth-connected accounts (CRM, call recorder, chat) and needs NO keys here.
# Only fill these in if one of your systems requires an API key that isn't handled by the OAuth connection.

# Example (uncomment and set if needed):
# CRM_API_KEY=your-crm-api-key
# CALL_RECORDER_API_KEY=your-call-recorder-api-key
